From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sxs: IAssemblyName properties, IAssemblyCacheItem, install references (3718)

sxs: IAssemblyName properties, IsEqual, Clone; IAssemblyCacheItem; install references

IAssemblyName::SetProperty/GetProperty/Finalize/IsEqual/Clone, the
CreateAssemblyCacheItem object (CreateStream, Commit, AbortItem) and
the application references of InstallAssembly/UninstallAssembly with
their dispositions were E_NOTIMPL. Details and guesses in notes/3718.txt.
---
